{% include "partials/pagehero.njk" %}

<section>
  <div class="wrap two">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--blue">The academic core</p>
      <h2>Subject teachers, real practical work</h2>
      <p>Each core subject has a teacher with a degree in it. <strong>English</strong> moves into literature and argument. <strong>Maths</strong> builds toward IGCSE. <strong>Science</strong> covers biology, chemistry and physics, with practical work every week.</p>
      <p>Students also take <strong>History</strong> and <strong>Executive Function</strong>: learning to plan, organise and finish things.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="leaf-wrap leaf-wrap--r has-sticker">
      <span class="sticker sticker--blue sticker--tr">Cambridge Lower Secondary</span>
      {% photo "secondary-ramp-experiment", "photo--lg photo--tilt-r" %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="center narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--blue">In the lab</p>
      <h2>Science you put goggles on for</h2>
      <p class="lede">Practical work every week, across biology, chemistry and physics.</p>
    </div>
    {% set collagePhotos = ["secondary-lab-preparing-sample", "secondary-lab-weighing", "secondary-lab-group-practical"] %}
    {% include "partials/collage.njk" %}
    <div class="center narrow mt">
      <p>Every practical starts the same way: goggles on, apron on, gloves on, bench clear. Then students prepare their own samples, weigh them, run the test and write up what the numbers actually say. <strong>Art of Science</strong> in the afternoon picks up whatever the morning's lesson opened up.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% set waveColor = "pale" %}{% include "partials/wave.njk" %}
